<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Puntland</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Puntland is an autonomous state in north-eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/somalia">Somalia</a>, declared in 1998 by clan leaders after the collapse of the central government. Its capital is Garowe, and it includes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cape-guardafui">Cape Guardafui</a> and the ports of Bosaso and Eyl. It remains part of the Federal Republic of Somalia, unlike neighbouring <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-somaliland">Somaliland</a>, which claims full independence.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/puntland.jpg" alt="Puntland" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Own work · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Puntland.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
